flowchart TD
    INV[Raw Invoice Line Net + Rates] --> SPLIT{Jurisdiction}
    SPLIT -->|Egypt ETA v1.0| T2["Compute T2 Table Tax = Net * T2_Rate"]
    T2 --> BASE["Compound VAT Base = Net + T2"]
    BASE --> T1["Compute T1 VAT = Base * 0.14"]
    T1 --> GROSS["Gross Receivable = Net + T2 + T1"]
    GROSS --> PAY["Buyer Settlement: Cash + T4 WHT == Gross"]
    PAY --> T4["Verify T4 == Net * WHT_Rate (Excl. VAT)"]
    SPLIT -->|Saudi ZATCA Phase 2| LINE["Per-Line VAT Rounding (halala)"]
    LINE --> DRIFT{Header vs Sum Drift != 0?}
    DRIFT -->|Yes: BR-CO-14 Risk| Z3OPT["Z3 Integer Delta Allocator +/- 1 halala"]
    Z3OPT --> UBL["Emit Compliant UBL 2.1 XML TaxTotal"]
    DRIFT -->|No| UBL
